'''Blackroot Hold''' is a large village of corrupted [[furbolg]]s located in southwestern [[Moonwhisper Coast]]. The village is ruled by [[Grawlsh the Mad]], who resides in the [[Maw of Ursol]]. After the corruption from within [[Timbermaw Hold]] seeped into the Blackroot furbolgs, they raided [[Sunsworn Camp]] and stole supplies meant to last the expedition the month.<ref>{{questlong|Alliance|54|Blackroot Hold (quest)|Blackroot Hold}}</ref>

